        "original_id": "e95f4a23-5714-5d37-a8d7-97e31ad76cd2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: House of Grimaldi, Republic of Genoa\n- Places: Italy, Principality of Monaco, Liguria, Corsica, Mediterranean\n- Topics: History, independent states\n\nFacts:\n- The Republic of Genoa was an independent state in Liguria on the northwestern Italian coast from 1005 to 1797.\n- The Republic of Genoa incorporated Corsica from 1347 to 1768.\n- The Republic of Genoa held numerous other territories throughout the Mediterranean.\n- The House of Grimaldi is associated with the history of the Republic of Genoa in Italy and with the history of the Principality of Monaco.",
